@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Login admin (ajustar credenciales)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/SGR/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe!"
}

### GET padron vehículos
GET {{baseUrl}}/USR/Automoviles/padron
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST vehículo admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/USR/Automoviles/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuarioId": 2,
  "placas": "TST-999",
  "color": "Gris"
}

### PUT vehículo admin
PUT {{baseUrl}}/USR/Automoviles/1/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "placas": "TST-998",
  "color": "Azul"
}

### DELETE vehículo admin
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/USR/Automoviles/1/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
